  "descriptionMarkdown": "This is a fully beaconed compact science outpost for Factorio 2.0 (base game). \nAll it needs are input ore lines and it will produce all science excluding military science at a rate of about 100 per minute. Note that due to the space science changes in Factorio 2.0, space science gets deposited into a cargo landing pad, so a requester chest is now used for space science in this outpost. Also features circuit controlled cracking and circuit controlled satellite launch.\n\nConsumes:\n- About 1.8 blue belts of iron\n- About 1.3 blue belts of copper\n- About 0.3 blue belts of stone\n- About 0.2 blue belts of coal\n- 14988 flow/s of water\n- 9264 flow/s of crude oil\n\nOutput:\n- 96 of all science (minus military science) per minute\n\n",
